OL,3,GNEWSA'Splitting county in two will be a
OL,4,Adisaster'
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans to split Worcestershire into two
OL,7,Fcouncils have been branded a "disaster"
OL,8,Fand a "disgrace" by the Reform UK
OL,9,Fcounty leader.
OL,11,FAlan Amos, leader of the county's
OL,12,FReform group, said the proposed
OL,13,Fshake-up of local government was "going
OL,14,Fto be chaotic" and would increase costs
OL,15,Fby duplicating services.
OL,17,FIf plans go ahead Worcestershire County
OL,18,FCouncil and the six district councils
OL,19,Fwould be replaced with two new unitary
OL,20,Fauthorities covering the north and
OL,21,Fsouth of the county.
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,356,350,200,160,0,100
