OL,3,GNEWSA'Splitting county in two will be a
OL,4,Adisaster'
OL,5,
OL,6,FJust hours after Amos's comments The
OL,7,FMinistry of Housing, Communities and
OL,8,FLocal Government announced it would be
OL,9,Freviewing the proposals.
